{
  "description": "std-agent-suggestions — an agent that proactively proposes things to the signed-in person, who accepts or dismisses each one. The agent proposes through one declared input, PROPOSE_SUGGESTION (its @description is the tool text): a kind, a title, a body that gives its reasoning, an optional action (a name the app routes) with a payload, an optional href, and a subject (what it is about). A suggestion's signature is kind:action:subject; a signature that was ever proposed to this person, accepted or dismissed included, is never stored again (SUGGESTION_DUPLICATE), and no more than `maxPending` wait at once (SUGGESTION_LIMIT_REACHED). `kinds` and `actions`, when listed, are the only values accepted (SUGGESTION_REJECTED). The agent runs on its own: any trait emitting SUGGESTIONS_TRIGGERED (or an app event routed into AgentSuggestionTrigger's TRIGGERED by re-binding that trait in the import body with `omit { AgentSuggestionTrigger }` and its own `listens`) asks for a run, and once `cooldownMinutes` have passed since this person's last run a second std-agent-tool-loop answers `prompt` with `tools` as the signed-in person — `quiet`, so it streams no live steps and toasts no failure, and its reply and failure are renamed PROACTIVE_REPLIED / PROACTIVE_FAILED so they never reach the assistant's chat. AgentSuggestionInbox lists the pending suggestions with Accept and Dismiss and an empty state that offers to look again (SUGGESTIONS_ANALYZE_REQUESTED). Accept stores accepted, emits SUGGESTION_ACCEPTED { action, payload, href, … } for the app to route (and navigates to `href` when the suggestion has one); Dismiss stores dismissed and emits SUGGESTION_DISMISSED. The inbox renders into `panelSlot`: `main` inline (the content of a std-panel-launcher), or `modal`/`drawer` opened with OPEN and closed with CLOSE (set std-app-layout's notificationClickEvent, or a topBarActions event, to SUGGESTIONS_OPEN_REQUESTED). Import the orbital once per app: `orbital Suggestions = Suggest.orbitals.AgentSuggestionsOrbital { entity MySuggestion  entities { AgentSuggestionRun: MySuggestionRun } config { … } }`, retargeting the records onto owner-scoped entities (`ownerId` a relation to your [identity] roster, with @read/@create/@update); a suggestion's proposer, inbox and trigger read only the rows whose ownerId is the signed-in person. PROPOSE_SUGGESTION's refusals (SUGGESTION_DUPLICATE, SUGGESTION_LIMIT_REACHED, SUGGESTION_REJECTED) are the agent's tool response; no trait listens to them. Suggestion kinds, actions and prompts are the app's vocabulary, declared in config.",
